1
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:29,960
My Lord Shuo,

2
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:31,600
can we please stop doing things

3
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:32,120
that hurt the enemy

4
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,240
but hurt us more?

5
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,360
What if you catch a cold?

6
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,090
Understood.

7
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:40,920
Miss Tang.

8
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,400
Slow down.

9
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,280
You're sick.

10
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:02,980
It's nothing serious.

11
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,640
Just a slight cold.

12
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,850
I have already taken the medicine.

13
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:12,000
Is this a birthmark too?

14
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,280
It is a birthmark.

15
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,160
Young Master Su is right.

16
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:24,520
It is indeed easy to catch a cold in this season.

17
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:27,640
Let me examine you.

18
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:45,640
Could it be

19
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,800
that destiny really exists?

20
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,040
What are you thinking about?

21
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:55,920
You look so lost in thought.

22
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,760
Nothing.

23
00:02:58,160 --> 00:03:00,220
What's the situation with Yuwen Jia?

24
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,600
He is busy with disaster relief.

25
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,200
By the way,

26
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,360
he is planning

27
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,920
to marry into Rouran during their internal strife

28
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,240
to increase his chances of winning the succession.

29
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,970
Didn't he contact Tang Zhiluo?

30
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,760
Jingxuan,

31
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:12,920
as a friend,

32
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,280
I want to advise you.

33
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,920
Being cautious is a good thing,

34
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,240
but being overly cautious

35
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:19,840
will push away those who have good intentions.

36
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:19,600
I thought you were someone formidable.

37
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:22,520
You showed your true colors so quickly.

38
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:26,300
Your Highness, are you there?

39
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,600
It's time for your medicine.

40
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,720
Before taking the medicine,

41
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,040
I have something

42
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,400
to give to Miss Tang.

43
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,000
I forgot.

44
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:04,480
Miss Tang

45
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,920
can't see.

46
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,300
So Your Highness was worried about this.

47
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,610
Do you know what you are eating?

48
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,640
Of course I do.

49
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,290
It's just poisonous plant leaves.

50
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,700
Should I praise your honesty,

51
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:37,050
or your fearlessness of death?

52
00:05:38,159 --> 00:05:39,690
I am indeed afraid of death.

53
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:42,680
But I'm more afraid of living in ignorance.

54
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,560
Medicine and poison,

55
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,040
just like life and death,

56
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,740
are two sides of the same coin.

57
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:51,600
That day, I deliberately left the prescription for Your Highness,

58
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,260
thinking you would verify it.

59
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:55,740
It seems I was not thoughtful enough.

60
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:57,960
I should have told you directly.

61
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,440
Then this dead tree...

62
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,640
Since it's medicine,

63
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:02,370
the dosage must be precise.

64
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,570
Although this dosage can kill a potted plant,

65
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:07,970
it is far from a lethal dose for a human.

66
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:24,840
From now on, I will personally deliver

67
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,370
Your Highness's medicine.

68
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:28,700
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

69
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:32,860
Do you think I'm afraid of you?

70
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:55,840
I shall take my leave.

71
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:42,720
Thank you.

72
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,680
It's Young Master Su.

73
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:47,560
I thought it was Miss Yunling.

74
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,210
You're welcome.

75
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,600
The palace sent new servants.

76
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,720
She was afraid there might be spies among them,

77
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:56,380
so she had to settle them herself to feel at ease.

78
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,440
So she couldn't accompany you to brew the medicine.

79
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,840
I'm here to help instead.

80
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:04,170
There isn't really anything I need help with.

81
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,720
Jingxuan is not taking his medicine properly again.

82
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,000
You are so careful.

83
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:14,250
Isn't your devotion being wasted?

84
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,560
Although His Highness is cautious,

85
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:20,160
he is quite obedient when taking his medicine.

86
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,280
Please don't blame him, Miss Tang.

87
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,800
When Jingxuan was born,

88
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:27,180
the late Empress passed away.

89
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,880
The Emperor despised him

90
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:31,040
and ignored him completely.

91
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,880
Washing clothes and cooking in winter,

92
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,760
repelling insects and relieving heat in summer,

93
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:36,440
only Yunling was by his side.

94
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,770
Naturally, he wouldn't easily trust others.

95
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,160
No wonder Miss Yunling

96
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:43,320
has many small cuts on her hands

97
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:46,340
and traces of frostbite from winter.

98
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:47,600
What?

99
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,240
When you practiced medicine before,

100
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,900
haven't you heard the various rumors about him?

101
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:56,480
Such as being moody,

102
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,560
eccentric,

103
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:02,080
and gossip like having a father but no mother to teach him?

104
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:05,640
Although I have heard them,

105
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:07,180
I never believed them.

106
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:11,060
Why wouldn't I believe it?

107
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:12,840
If His Highness

108
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:15,200
were truly as the rumors say,

109
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:18,600
I wouldn't have heard so much gossip.

110
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,000
You two are truly

111
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,720
kindred spirits.

112
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:37,740
Has something been on your mind lately, Your Highness?

113
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:39,680
Why do you ask?

114
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:42,360
Your Highness's lung pulse shows sorrow,

115
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,360
your heart is restless,

116
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:45,080
and your liver fire is stagnant.

117
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,440
Although your meridians are clear,

118
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,000
if this continues long-term,

119
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:50,200
it will surely damage your foundation.

120
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:53,800
I will write you a prescription.

121
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,600
Please keep a light diet for a few days, Your Highness.

122
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,320
Medicine and food must complement each other.

123
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,320
Something happened.
